('Is the native app available now?', 'Native FeedFare 2026.9.28 is available on the App Store for iPhone and iPad with iOS or iPadOS 17 or later. Check the listing for your device’s compatibility and regional availability. These screenshots show the native app with example data, and appearance varies with your system settings.'),
('Is FeedFare a one-time purchase?', 'The native release has a one-time US $4.99 download price, with regional prices shown on the App Store. Check the App Store for your regional price before downloading. The full native app is included without an in-app paywall, trial, or required subscription. Existing FeedFare owners receive full native access when they install this update on a supported device. Previous subscription plans have been retired and no longer renew. You can review previous charges and any remaining subscription period in Apple’s subscription settings.'),
